  "arrangerNotes": "The folk-like main theme of the finale (8 bars), verified against the LilyPond score on English Wikipedia. 2/2 time written in quarter-note beats; the two opening bars of rest (bass drone only) are left out, and the bass pedal is not played. No simplification needed. Range low 5 to 5. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
